      "talk": "LionHeart seminar",
      "spk": "Oprah Winfrey",
      "ven": "Lumière · Tue 23, 10:00",
      "buzz": 95,
      "sent": "pos",
      "read": "Resisted being called a 'brand' for years, then reframed it as 'just an expression of yourself.' Her operating principle: set an intention before every show and check afterwards whether you met it. Told the Whitney Houston story — protecting a vulnerable guest over a ratings win — to argue trust can't be performed, only earned.",
